# Consumed by the LIBX11_COMPAT_REPLAY engine (see src/replay.c). Wait for the
# main window to map, move the pointer over the File cascade button at the left
# of the menu bar, and press Button1 to post the pulldown. Motif's menu-bar grab
# then maps the XmMenuShell, which the SDL3 backend must place as an xdg_popup
# anchored to the main window rather than a free-standing top-level.
delay 2500
target-motion 20 14
delay 100
button 1 press
delay 500
